simdlib_vector_type.nra:6:34: Simd.shiftLeft does not take F32x4, whose lanes are floats; it takes integer vectors
simdlib_vector_type.nra:8:29: Simd.abs does not take U32x4, which is unsigned; it takes signed and float vectors
simdlib_vector_type.nra:10:30: Simd.select takes the mask I32x4 for F32x4, found I64x2
simdlib_vector_type.nra:11:27: Simd.any does not take F32x4, whose lanes are floats; it takes integer vectors
simdlib_vector_type.nra:13:37: Simd.store writes F32x4 into an Array<f32>, found Array<f64>
simdlib_vector_type.nra:14:30: Simd.store changes its argument; write `mutable` before it
